'''Rapidash''' (Japanese: '''ギャロップ''' ''Gallop'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

