==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Rapidash|28}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Rapidash}}.
*'''Overdrive Smash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Genesect|86}}, one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

